data: {"id": "46dc81a2b142477f-thinking-parallel_evidence-2624", "run_id": "46dc81a2b142477f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已收到 baseline 日志、events 和 describe。关键缺口：**缺少 container exit code 的根因确认**（CrashLoopBackOff 但无 OOMKilled 或 Crash 日志）和 **Prometheus 指标**（是否有内存/CPU/错误率飙升）。需要立即补充 pod yaml 的 `containerStatuses` 完整信息和 Prometheus 诊断指标。\n\n首轮计划：\n1. `kubectl_get_yaml` (Pod) - 获取 containerStatuses (restarts, exitCode, reason, state)\n2. `execute_pod_promql` (instant) - 查询 container CPU/memory 指标（container_cpu_usage_seconds_total, container_memory_working_set_bytes）\n3. `execute_pod_promql` (range, last 30m) - 查询异常窗口内的指标增长趋势\n4.", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789397416274, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

